steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
      seconds: 1779772085
      nanos: 319882400
    }
    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Build a modern Android offline-first application for a pathology laboratory phlebotomist workflow.\n\nApp Name:\n\342\200\234Accurate Lab Collection App\342\200\235\n\nPlatform:\n\n* Android\n* Kotlin preferred\n* Material Design 3 UI\n* Offline-first architecture\n* Local SQLite or Room Database\n* Future-ready for cloud sync\n* Fast and lightweight for low-end Android devices\n\nMain Purpose:\nPhlebotomists should be able to quickly register patients during sample collection visits and instantly send formatted patient details to the laboratory WhatsApp number without wasting time.\n\n========================================\nCORE FEATURES\n=============\n\n1. LOGIN SYSTEM\n\n* Secure login screen\n* Role-based access:\n\n  * Admin\n  * Phlebotomist/User\n* Remember login option\n* Offline login support after first authentication\n* Logout option\n\n========================================\n2. PATIENT ENTRY SCREEN\n=======================\n\nFields Required:\n\n* Patient Name (required)\n* Age (required)\n* Sex/Gender (dropdown: Male/Female/Other)\n* Referred Doctor Name\n* Test Selection\n* Mobile Number (optional)\n* Email (optional)\n* Address (optional)\n* Sample Collection Type:\n\n  * Home Collection\n  * Lab Visit\n* Date & Time auto-generated\n* Unique Patient Entry ID auto-generated\n\nUI Requirements:\n\n* Very fast single-page entry\n* Large touch-friendly buttons\n* Searchable test selection\n* Multi-test selection\n* Auto total estimate calculation\n* Clean professional UI for field workers\n\n========================================\n3. TEST MANAGEMENT\n==================\n\nAdmin Features:\n\n* Add new test\n* Edit test name\n* Edit test price\n* Delete test\n* Create test categories:\n\n  * Hematology\n  * Biochemistry\n  * Serology\n  * Hormones\n  * Packages\n  * Others\n\nUser Features:\n\n* Search tests quickly\n* Select multiple tests\n* See running total instantly\n\nAdditional:\n\n* Frequently used tests shortcut\n* Recent tests history\n* Favorite tests pinning\n\n========================================\n4. PAYMENT & QR SYSTEM\n======================\n\nIntegrate lab UPI QR code.\n\nFeatures:\n\n* Show QR code after estimate generation\n* Display:\n\n  * UPI ID\n  * Amount payable\n* Payment status options:\n\n  * Paid\n  * Partial\n  * Pending\n* Payment mode:\n\n  * UPI\n  * Cash\n  * Card\n  * Credit\n\nOptional:\n\n* Auto-generate dynamic UPI payment link\n\n========================================\n5. WHATSAPP INTEGRATION\n=======================\n\nAfter saving patient entry:\nGenerate a clean formatted WhatsApp message automatically.\n\nMessage Format Example:\n\n---\n\nPatient Entry\n\nName: Rajesh Kumar\nAge/Sex: 45/M\nDoctor: Dr. Sharma\nTests:\n\n* CBC\n* LFT\n* HbA1c\n\nMobile: 9876543210\nCollection: Home Visit\n\nEstimated Amount: \342\202\2711850\nPayment Status: Pending\n\nCollected By: Amit\nDate: 19-05-2026 10:42 AM\n-------------------------\n\nRequirements:\n\n* One-tap \342\200\234Send to Lab WhatsApp\342\200\235 button\n* Open WhatsApp directly\n* Message should be clean and copy-friendly\n* Support multiple lab WhatsApp numbers\n\n========================================\n6. OFFLINE-FIRST FUNCTIONALITY\n==============================\n\nApp must work completely without internet.\n\nRequirements:\n\n* Save all entries locally\n* Sync-ready architecture for future\n* Local backup support\n* Export database option\n* Auto-save drafts\n\n========================================\n7. ADMIN PANEL\n==============\n\nAdmin should control:\n\n* User accounts\n* Test prices\n* Test list\n* QR code image\n* Lab WhatsApp numbers\n* Export reports\n* View daily collections\n* View pending payments\n\nReports:\n\n* Daily patient count\n* Revenue summary\n* User-wise collections\n* Pending payments report\n\n========================================\n8. SEARCH & HISTORY\n===================\n\nFeatures:\n\n* Search previous patients\n* Recent entries\n* Repeat patient quick-fill\n* Edit previous entries\n* Duplicate patient option\n\n========================================\n9. SECURITY\n===========\n\n* Local database encryption\n* Admin PIN for sensitive settings\n* Prevent accidental deletion\n* Auto backup reminder\n\n========================================\n10. UI/UX REQUIREMENTS\n======================\n\nTheme:\n\n* Clean medical theme\n* Minimal clicks\n* Fast workflow\n\nScreens:\n\n* Splash Screen\n* Login\n* Dashboard\n* New Patient Entry\n* Test Management\n* Reports\n* Settings\n\nDashboard Cards:\n\n* Today\342\200\231s Patients\n* Today\342\200\231s Revenue\n* Pending Payments\n* Recent Entries\n\n========================================\n11. FUTURE READY FEATURES\n=========================\n\nArchitecture should support future addition of:\n\n* Thermal printer support\n* Bluetooth label printer\n* Cloud sync\n* Barcode generation\n* PDF receipt\n* SMS/email report sending\n* LIS integration\n* API integration\n* Multi-branch support\n\n========================================\n12. TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS\n==========================\n\nUse:\n\n* Kotlin\n* MVVM architecture\n* Room Database\n* Coroutines\n* Material Design 3\n* RecyclerView\n* ViewModel\n* Clean architecture\n\nGenerate:\n\n* Full Android Studio project\n* Proper folder structure\n* Reusable components\n* Documentation\n* Setup instructions\n\n========================================\n13. EXTRA SMART FEATURES\n========================\n\nAdd:\n\n* Voice input for patient name\n* Auto age calculator from DOB\n* Dark mode\n* Multi-language support (English + Gujarati)\n* QR scanner for repeat patients\n* CSV export\n* Share receipt image\n* Collection status tracking:\n\n  * Sample Collected\n  * Sent to Lab\n  * Report Ready\n  * Delivered\n\n========================================\n14. PERFORMANCE REQUIREMENTS\n============================\n\n* App should open fast\n* Handle 10,000+ offline records smoothly\n* Low battery usage\n* Works on Android 8 and above\n\n========================================\n15. DELIVERABLES\n================\n\nGenerate:\n\n* Complete source code\n* Database schema\n* UI screens\n* APK build instructions\n* Sample data\n* README documentation\n\nFocus heavily on:\n\n* Speed\n* Ease of use during field collection\n* Minimal typing\n* Reliability in offline areas\n* Professional medical workflow\n"
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Build an Android app\"\nicon: \"android_color\"\n---\n\n"
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      text: "Build a modern Android offline-first application for a pathology laboratory phlebotomist workflow.\n\nApp Name:\n\342\200\234Accurate Lab Collection App\342\200\235\n\nPlatform:\n\n* Android\n* Kotlin preferred\n* Material Design 3 UI\n* Offline-first architecture\n* Local SQLite or Room Database\n* Future-ready for cloud sync\n* Fast and lightweight for low-end Android devices\n\nMain Purpose:\nPhlebotomists should be able to quickly register patients during sample collection visits and instantly send formatted patient details to the laboratory WhatsApp number without wasting time.\n\n========================================\nCORE FEATURES\n=============\n\n1. LOGIN SYSTEM\n\n* Secure login screen\n* Role-based access:\n\n  * Admin\n  * Phlebotomist/User\n* Remember login option\n* Offline login support after first authentication\n* Logout option\n\n========================================\n2. PATIENT ENTRY SCREEN\n=======================\n\nFields Required:\n\n* Patient Name (required)\n* Age (required)\n* Sex/Gender (dropdown: Male/Female/Other)\n* Referred Doctor Name\n* Test Selection\n* Mobile Number (optional)\n* Email (optional)\n* Address (optional)\n* Sample Collection Type:\n\n  * Home Collection\n  * Lab Visit\n* Date & Time auto-generated\n* Unique Patient Entry ID auto-generated\n\nUI Requirements:\n\n* Very fast single-page entry\n* Large touch-friendly buttons\n* Searchable test selection\n* Multi-test selection\n* Auto total estimate calculation\n* Clean professional UI for field workers\n\n========================================\n3. TEST MANAGEMENT\n==================\n\nAdmin Features:\n\n* Add new test\n* Edit test name\n* Edit test price\n* Delete test\n* Create test categories:\n\n  * Hematology\n  * Biochemistry\n  * Serology\n  * Hormones\n  * Packages\n  * Others\n\nUser Features:\n\n* Search tests quickly\n* Select multiple tests\n* See running total instantly\n\nAdditional:\n\n* Frequently used tests shortcut\n* Recent tests 