Edit previous entries\n* Duplicate patient option\n\n========================================\n9. SECURITY\n===========\n\n* Local database encryption\n* Admin PIN for sensitive settings\n* Prevent accidental deletion\n* Auto backup reminder\n\n========================================\n10. UI/UX REQUIREMENTS\n======================\n\nTheme:\n\n* Clean medical theme\n* Minimal clicks\n* Fast workflow\n\nScreens:\n\n* Splash Screen\n* Login\n* Dashboard\n* New Patient Entry\n* Test Management\n* Reports\n* Settings\n\nDashboard Cards:\n\n* Today\342\200\231s Patients\n* Today\342\200\231s Revenue\n* Pending Payments\n* Recent Entries\n\n========================================\n11. FUTURE READY FEATURES\n=========================\n\nArchitecture should support future addition of:\n\n* Thermal printer support\n* Bluetooth label printer\n* Cloud sync\n* Barcode generation\n* PDF receipt\n* SMS/email report sending\n* LIS integration\n* API integration\n* Multi-branch support\n\n========================================\n12. TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS\n==========================\n\nUse:\n\n* Kotlin\n* MVVM architecture\n* Room Database\n* Coroutines\n* Material Design 3\n* RecyclerView\n* ViewModel\n* Clean architecture\n\nGenerate:\n\n* Full Android Studio project\n* Proper folder structure\n* Reusable components\n* Documentation\n* Setup instructions\n\n========================================\n13. EXTRA SMART FEATURES\n========================\n\nAdd:\n\n* Voice input for patient name\n* Auto age calculator from DOB\n* Dark mode\n* Multi-language support (English + Gujarati)\n* QR scanner for repeat patients\n* CSV export\n* Share receipt image\n* Collection status tracking:\n\n  * Sample Collected\n  * Sent to Lab\n  * Report Ready\n  * Delivered\n\n========================================\n14. PERFORMANCE REQUIREMENTS\n============================\n\n* App should open fast\n* Handle 10,000+ offline records smoothly\n* Low battery usage\n* Works on Android 8 and above\n\