    modified_response: "To get your downloadable APK file, you can generate and download it directly from the Google AI Studio platform interface. \n\nPlease follow these simple instructions:\n\n### How to Download the APK:\n1. **Access the Top-Right Menu:** Locate the project toolbar or settings panel in the top-right corner of your **Google AI Studio Build** browser window.\n2. **Build and Download:** Click on the **Download** or **Export** option. Under this menu, you can:\n   * **Generate APK:** Triggers a cloud build of the production/debug `.apk` file ready to be saved to your computer or phone.\n   * **Export ZIP:** Export the entire clean Kotlin/Jetpack Compose source code project, which can be opened and run directly in **Android Studio**.\n\n---\n\n### What\'s Inside the Built App\nYour offline-first pathology workflow app is fully packaged with the following core engines:\n* **Offline-First Security & Storage:** Formed on standard lightweight Android Room SQLite databases, loaded with preset pathologically tuned clinical diagnostic tests (Hematology, Biochemistry, Serology, Packages, etc.).\n* **Dynamic Low-Friction Entry Form:** Fast single-page registration featuring an automated unique record ID generator (e.g., `ALC-20260526-xxxx`), dynamic balance estimation, and horizontal clickers for low-power handheld device speed.\n* **One-Tap WhatsApp & UPI QR Ecosystem:** Configurable Lab WhatsApp numbers with zero-overhead native sharing sheets, paired with procedural India-standard UPI payment vector QR rendering (supports auto-filled dynamic amounts and patient identifiers).\n* **Multi-Language Adaptability:** English and Gujarati bilingual translations built into the core layout resources for field-worker ergonomics."
